          {
            "id": "q4",
            "type": "single",
            "question": "4. 假设有一个链表的节点定义如下：\n\n```cpp\nstruct Node {\n    int data;\n    Node* next;\n};\n```\n\n现在有一个指向链表头部的指针：Node* head。如果想要在链表中插入一个新节点，使其成员 data 的值为 42，并使新节点成为链表的第一个节点，下面哪个操作是正确的？（ ）",
            "options": [
              {
                "value": "A",
                "label": "Node* newNode = new Node; newNode->data = 42; newNode->next = head; head = newNode;"
              },
              {
                "value": "B",
                "label": "Node* newNode = new Node; head->data = 42; newNode->next = head; head = newNode;"
              },
              {
                "value": "C",
                "label": "Node* newNode = new Node; newNode->data = 42; head->next = newNode;"
              },
              {
                "value": "D",
                "label": "Node* newNode = new Node; newNode->data = 42; newNode->next = head;"
              }
            ],
            "answer": [
              "A"
            ],
            "analysis": "头插法四步：① new Node 创建新节点；② newNode->data = 42 设值；③ newNode->next = head 让新节点指向原头；④ head = newNode 更新头指针。缺第④步会丢节点（D），错把 head->data 改了（B），把 newNode 接到 head 后面是尾插（C）。",
            "points": 2,
            "hasAnswer": true
          },
